<title>UK: Berlin Hanover Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark bond.</title>
<headline>Berlin Hanover Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bankgesellschaft Berlin, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson, Norddeutsche Landesbank and Westdeutsche Genossenschafts-Zentralbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BERLIN HANOVER HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    04.MAR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    20.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.29	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+4 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.11	SELL CONC  0.18	DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p> LISTING    BERLIN/HANOVER		     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND MARCH 2004 TREUHAND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
